<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche first-half sales data due on July 15.</title>
<headline>Roche first-half sales data due on July 15.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roche Holding AG said it would publish group sales figures for the first half of 1997 on July 15 before the Swiss Exchange opens at 0800 GMT.</p>
<p>Its full half-year report will be issued in mid-August, it said in a statement without giving any other details.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
